      "key": [
        "Dottore",
        "the Doctor",
        "Il Dottore"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rerir"
      ],
      "comment": "Rerir: Dottore and the revival",
      "content": "By unknown means Dottore revived Rerir from the moon's reflection and used him to gather his fragments, timing the return for when Columbina was weakest. Rerir cared nothing for Dottore's research; his own obsession with the moons simply aligned with Dottore's plans for the time being.",
