        "Boom and Blast Kuuvahki Cannon",
        "Aino's cannon"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rerir"
      ],
      "comment": "Rerir: The Boom and Blast Kuuvahki Cannon",
      "content": "Rerir used kuuvahki and Abyssal energy's opposition to restore part of his body: he abducted Sousi, wore Sousi's and Flins's forms to turn Nasha Town toward firing it, and had it aimed at himself at Starsand Shoal. Ineffa lifted the barrel to redirect the shot. Part of his power, not all, returned.",
